    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's get ready to THUUUMBLE!</strong> Thumblemania is a  wrestling game focusing on smashing action, fun characters and entertaining stories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/a3f3d19d378a132008ee0139575bc4cf.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your favourite wrestler and fight against others in PvE, PvP either alone or in coop. Unlock new characters, entertain the crowd and get all the titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/099f3aeed052f9d227d05ce1be80dcec.poster.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/099f3aeed052f9d227d05ce1be80dcec.webm?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/099f3aeed052f9d227d05ce1be80dcec.mp4?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/e71104c2900c583e315a831f59d6c45e.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each wrestler is different!</strong> Choose between strong, large, agile and technical wrestlers. All with unique moves, stats and characteristics \u2013 <u>and of course: each wrestler has its own supernatural finishing move</u>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/d3b2f5b5a95e48d17e03cba5e0d0acc6.poster.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/d3b2f5b5a95e48d17e03cba5e0d0acc6.webm?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/d3b2f5b5a95e48d17e03cba5e0d0acc6.mp4?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/dd0490bde367363cf216e2275fbde483.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to give your friends, your family or your boss a  thumb up right in the face? You've come to the right place. In Thumblemania you can smash the buttons in several game modes and events:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1vs1,\u00a02vs2, 3vs3, 4vs4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag Team Matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title Matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Championships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal Rumble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Thumb up (Last Man Standing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commander Mode (1 team captain and 2 members)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more to come</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/ea46b976f82633641c8192c36ed19f04.poster.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/ea46b976f82633641c8192c36ed19f04.webm?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/ea46b976f82633641c8192c36ed19f04.mp4?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are <strong>YOU</strong> ready to THUUUUMBLE?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/b4cc9ed1efcbf95019137623c7411186.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
