"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/ea46b976f82633641c8192c36ed19f04.mp4?t=1754598845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are <strong>YOU</strong> ready to THUUUUMBLE?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757440/extras/b4cc9ed1efcbf95019137623c7411186.avif?t=1754598845\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
